{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2000_place", "source_sha256": "f85c48935d35a0f40c2ac20225bc5f46401ad855ef9d14e033b7a2505516d23c", "ja": "握手会会場", "zh": "握手会会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2001_046rio", "source_sha256": "e3dfd8754c2da0c208a5ed22ea111e1fa66c2de71381a85cba2078031bf064e7", "ja": "今日は大勢来てくれたわね！　でもなんだか、\nあんまり話しかけられなかった気がするのよね……。", "zh": "今天来了好多人！但总觉得，\n没有多少人开口跟我说话呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "d883846e0fb4c86e540a08c4f24a4f99c9cf007118548a53c41df63c870a299f", "ja": "ファンの人達と近くで話せる機会って少ないのに、\nどうしてかしら？", "zh": "明明很少有机会能和粉丝近距离对话，\n大家是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2003_p", "source_sha256": "c78c63aec392eeaced0476910a0dc928f789139fb0ed24ec9a06132da78a8540", "ja": "それは、照れてるんじゃないかな……。\n莉緒は近くで見ると、なかなか刺激的というか……。", "zh": "应该是因为害羞吧……\n近距离见到莉绪，可能是太刺激了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2004_046rio", "source_sha256": "82bdb9ba68dd2e5fcf67db70770fc153ae8b72f0a7412e81f4659c21f93f1dc8", "ja": "なんだ……みんな、本当は嬉しいのね！　なら、\n次はもっとサービスしなくちゃ！　胸元を、こう……。", "zh": "什么嘛……所以大家其实很开心呀！\n那下次得要给更多福利才行了！胸前要这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_2005_p", "source_sha256": "f7001191f1040bfeab558a0feb8b7fbb5e192527c3db19fcd1801b893fb10b3d", "ja": "ま、待つんだ、莉緒。これ以上露出したら、お客さんが\n話すどころか、目も合わせられなくなるからな……！", "zh": "等、等一下，莉绪，你要是再露更多，别说交谈了，\n客人会连眼神都没办法跟你对上啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
